/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 581 0 R
/T (Ans-India is one of the largest producers of e-waste, but over 90% of it is handled by the informal sector, who burn electronics to extract metals, causing massive toxic pollution. Most people keep old tech in drawers because recycling it is too inconvenient.)
/E (Ans-India is one of the largest producers of e-waste, but over 90% of it is handled by the informal sector, who burn electronics to extract metals, causing massive toxic pollution. Most people keep old tech in drawers because recycling it is too inconvenient.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
