/Title (Ans-It is important now because the amount of electronic waste in India is growing rapidly as people replace phones, laptops, and other devices more frequently. Many old devices are simply stored at home or sold through informal channels, where unsafe recycling can cause pollution and health risks. A convenient system that gives people instant rewards for responsibly recycling their electronics can increase participation while also recovering valuable materials.)
